invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the ticket shape admits an identity one byte over CH_TICKET_ID_MAX,
  the largest one CH_HELLO_MAX makes room for, so the config passes
  and the hello does not fit. The first-invalid identity row objects.

--- old
cfg->psk_id_len <= CH_TICKET_ID_MAX &&
--- new
cfg->psk_id_len <= CH_TICKET_ID_MAX + 1 &&
